          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Vehicles such as scooters, motorbikes, cars, and buses have an instrument which measures and displays the vehicle’s speed in km/h. It is called a speedometer. Another instrument, known as an odometer, is also fitted in the vehicles that measures the distance travelled by the vehicle in kilometre."
            }
          ]
        },
